            "title": "Designed to Love. Born to Last.",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_pTGjD6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We know how precious those first few months and years are. Our safe, sustainable, and so sweet baby goods are made to last (and love). Designed with durability and functionality in mind, our products are tried and tested by parents like you. That means you can be confident they will hold up, no matter what life (or baby) throws at them. Our commitment to the highest safety and sustainability standards and family-first focus means you can feel good about everything you find here.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
