          "settings": {
            "title": "How It All Began",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_qhAFRT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We got our start in 2015 with our first two designs, the original silicone Donut and Ice Cream Teethers that broke the mold for safety, durability, with a sweet aesthetic that fit seamlessly into our homes … but the fun was just getting started. We’ve continued expanding, but stayed committed to quality and accessibility. All of our products are ASTM, CPSC and CPSIA compliant, because every little one—and parent—deserves the best.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
